        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You perceive cosmo directly. You gain an <strong>imprecise</strong> sense with a range of 60 feet that detects everything with a cosmo.</p><p>You are never off-guard to undetected or hidden creatures, and you cannot be flanked by anything your sixth sense perceives.</p><p>The sense and the immunity to flanking are on the sheet. \"Never off-guard to undetected or hidden creatures\" is a note: pf2e applies that off-guard from the attacker's side, and there is no rule element that refuses it.</p>"
        },
